ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJgxyjQwLiwQ7kNvwF6IV32&_nc_oc=Adpjmuy-GaSKkzg8L6fuZ4td1t_BBkNGhwRe5_A3mLSEgQiHV3vLmmCzivdirbBoomw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSmWOfkgDo3NSvWhyb8485iIc8lxCAc_TJOFHWQqJDJOQ&oe=6B005BD6"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BN4hSPrzUl0Q7kNvwE-cvsa&_nc_oc=AdqR9EgG-IMJe50JqvpdXnSlTohHKXMCnvziAik2WF-JHDM_ZSpuCnbbCJ47WxfwUhA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjmmMznMqIUEhn1BsQcDaq9SRjfLkihdET1XR787pspg&oe=6B005F5C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v2HtBwRYlmwQ7kNvwHn-_tk&_nc_oc=AdrORY5O-9H6RdeNEBhgHZBiusyupQgEmuVB3SSIElTNSMj-GLDNeklfiF0wnQwDMdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQReBSjpKBm24XKDxqU3G6WUinG_DlM4H79uxgRGgDTLuA&oe=6B0078DB"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486